Kumbhakarṇa roars shaking sea and mountains --- Monkeys see deathlike Kumbhakarṇa and flee in terror --- Aṅgada names Nala Nīla Gavākṣa Kumuda and shames flight --- Monkeys rally and hurl peaks rocks and flowering trees --- Kumbhakarṇa unmoved as rocks shatter and trees break --- Kumbhakarṇa churns hosts like fire as monkeys fall bloodied scatter to sea sky woods --- Aṅgada shames fugitives again leads R̥ṣabha Śarabha Nīla Hanumān chiefs back to battle